# EVERY FILE IN THIS DIRECTORY IS WITHHELD FROM THE REPOSITORY ON PURPOSE.
#
# The images here contain DERIVED NCAC/CCSA VEHICLE HULL GEOMETRY. Register E8
# (docs/CANONICAL_CORRECTIONS_REGISTER_2026-08-06.md) states the operative rule:
# "do not commit any derived NCAC/CCSA geometry to the public repo, and do not
# include it in a DesignSafe DOI, without written permission or a confirmed
# licence."
#
# E8 IS OPEN, NOT RESOLVED. Re-checked from the source zips on 2026-08-13
# (commit 1d78d06): the zips carry an embedded README, a CCSA GMU banner, a
# warranty disclaimer and an attribution request, and NO redistribution grant.
# The prior step (a), read the zips, is done; step (b), obtain written
# permission, is not. That session's verdict, quoted: a real-mesh render may NOT
# go in a public deliverable.
#
# AND THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC. Per .claude/memory/can-it-ford-github-repo-is-
# public.md, GitHub served a removed W&B key by SHA even after a filter-repo
# rewrite, so a push here is effectively permanent. An accidental `git add` of
# this directory would be difficult to undo.
#
# This .gitignore is the mechanical half of that rule. The documentary half is
# docs/THREE_CLASS_RENDER_FINDINGS_2026-08-14.md. If E8 closes with a confirmed
# licence, delete this file rather than force-adding around it, so the change is
# visible in history.
#
# Ignore everything here except this file itself.
*
!.gitignore
